  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1151/995/2025-02-04_23-09-18-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1127\" height=\"416\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fnjb6EKaDVJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1152291880218939412?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;color=orange&amp;link=https://discord.com/invite/njb6EKaDVJ\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fboosty.to%252fnukateam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/Boosty-Support_us-ff5f5f?logo=boosty&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;color=orange\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"28\"></a></span></p><h2><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>机械动力：枪械锻造</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">这个模组增加了完全动画化的蒸汽朋克枪械，可以使用机械动力模组的机制进行制作。<br>你可以通过NTGL枪包添加新武器或编辑现有武器，更多信息请参阅&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><a style=\"background-color:#ffffff;color:#000\" href=\"https://github.com/Jetug/NukaTeamGunLib/wiki/NTGL-gun-packs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NTGL维基</a></span><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>模组依赖</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/1065/184/64/64/638598725500886388.png\" width=\"60\" height=\"60\"></strong></a></span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nukateams-gun-lib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/975/675/256/256/638479191021440186.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"62\" height=\"62\"></a></p><h3><strong>&nbsp;武器</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">燧发枪</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">左轮手枪</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">霰弹枪</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">钉枪</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">加特林机枪</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">烈焰之枪<br></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">发射器</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">气动锤</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">破片手榴弹</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\">未来还会添加更多</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1334/810/guns.png\" width=\"1047\" height=\"785\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://goo.su/tALK5\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/4cedab81-cdf9-445c-8d4c-2bba7dc9a836.webp\" alt=\"\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fNukaTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/4cedab81-cdf9-445c-8d4c-2bba7dc9a836.webp&amp;n=-1\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fNukaTeam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/NukaTeam</a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cgs/settings/ https:/bisecthosting.com/NukaTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"> </a></span></p>",
